WEBVTT

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:22.240
We'll be right back.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.260
Thank you.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:37.760
What are you talking about, Totsu-san?

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.650
The day has come for the world to end.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:40.690
It's time for men to be born!

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:43.520
I'm going home!

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:49.960
What the hell are you talking about?

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.820
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:55.350
Come on, come on, come on!

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:56.460
I'm going to kill you!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.090
I'll get you a glass of water.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:14.220
I can't stop you!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:17.320
I can't stop you.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:22.650
All the young people these days are crazy.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:29.000
I'm not stupid.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:31.180
You call that a good one?

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.530
You'll only get more after you die.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:34.500
Everyone's nervous.

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:37.080
That guy's got some nerve.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:39.910
Nobody's afraid of a man or a woman.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:47.530
Do you hear the strange noise of the 2030?

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:51.290
If you come out, I'll get you.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:57.210
Well, I collected the last of it.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.770
I wonder when Kinuichi will come back.

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.850
It's getting dark.

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:15.070
I've got a lot of stray dogs.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:20.580
I've got a lot of stray dogs.

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:23.500
I want Kinuichi back.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:31.970
Thank you.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.600
You

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:33.330
Hehehehe

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:40.570
If you want to go to the river, you can ask me.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.840
If you want to sell, you have to go to the market.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.510
One ryo for one ryo.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.740
Yes, I'll sell it.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.300
I have a good reputation.

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:53.010
I don't want to be a burden to women.

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:54.500
But I'm a little short now.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:57.630
I'll put it on the wall of the temple.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.250
Oh, look!

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:03.330
He's the head of the Ushitoro family.

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:07.410
His name is Hansuke Banta.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:11.380
I'd like to go with him, but I can't.

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:17.140
I'll be in trouble if I go with him.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:43.440
No, samurai, you can't sell such a thing.

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:44.820
You have to show a good place.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:46.160
Understand?

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.810
That guy is only tall.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.860
One of them will be quiet.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:57.010
Let's get rid of him.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:58.570
Who is this guy?

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:16.480
Hello, I'm Kikane.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:17.160
What?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.070
I want to eat.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:20.810
There's no business this time.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.540
I don't have anything.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:23.670
I want to order some food.

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:24.230
Okay.

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:44.480
Actually, I'll go back to this town for a while.

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:52.050
I'll give you some food, so get out of here.

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:55.620
I'm sorry.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:09.070
That's why I'm the only one who has a good reputation in this town.

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:11.610
I want to fly to Kan-Okiya every day.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.360
I didn't want to kill my sister.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:19.170
I can't stand it if I kill my father alone.

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:23.420
If I kill my father alone, I can't make money.

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:25.440
Kan-Okiya is the only place I can make money.

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:26.970
Shut up, father!

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:39.840
You know, it's common sense to have a mother and a son.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:43.580
But this is the son of a woman, who is a nobody.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:47.190
The real love for her is just like that.

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:49.440
He's a bad son.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.630
He's not like you.

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:54.100
He's like a bullfighter in a temple.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.910
Bullfighter is a funny name.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:59.250
He's a man who was a rich man and a good man.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:00.770
They were like a couple of tigers.

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:04.850
They were born on New Year's Eve and were so happy.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:09.530
He hit Seibe with a knife and ran into Shinden Village.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.100
Seibe and his family were shocked.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.290
Seibe and his family were shocked.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.610
Seibe and his family were shocked.

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:19.710
They drew eyes and wrote a poem.

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:27.140
The blood is on the ground and the dead is standing.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:42.930
What about you? How many rooms do you have in your room?

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:45.970
Two in my house.

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:46.370
What?

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:49.880
There are four in my house.

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:58.000
You're such a jerk.

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:13.950
It's Inokichi.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.810
As you can see, he's a wild boar.

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:18.310
If he goes wild, I'll kill him.

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:21.380
I'll kill three of them.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:43.510
That's the Banta of the Shikuba, isn't it?

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.190
You're the only one who can't catch a bug.

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:53.890
No, look at this.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:57.870
It's so good that you can't buy anything more expensive than this.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.690
It's not good enough.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.780
I can't do this, but I can't let Nanoshi's big name get away.

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:05.480
I've always been a big fan of Seibei.

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:15.680
But this time, this man made me the leader.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.010
He gave me the next name, and the next is me.

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.070
He even helped me with the car.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:22.820
Now I'm a rich man.

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:27.060
I'm just waiting for Seibei to win.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.240
Bye.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:01.990
Let's eat and get out of here.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.920
I don't want to eat.

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:06.110
Give me some alcohol.

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:10.390
I like this town.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:11.300
I'm going to die.

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:12.300
What?

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:15.280
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:20.080
I'm angry.

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:22.300
Listen to me.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.970
You can't kill people in this town.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:29.060
You'd better kill this town.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.190
Think about it.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:38.000
If Seibei, Ushitora, Bakuchiuchi, and the rest of us all die,

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:39.760
this place will be clean.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:41.080
That's impossible!

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:43.040
No matter how many of us die, we can't do that!

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:47.730
I'm not going to kill them all by myself.

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.460
Then what are you going to do?

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:53.060
I'm going to think about it while drinking alcohol.

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:03.960
I don't know what to do. I don't know what to do.

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:30.790
I have something to tell you.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:54.520
Show it to Nojimbo.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.600
What do you think you're talking about?

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:16.440
You guys are such a pain in the ass.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:16.860
What?

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:20.920
You guys are such a pain in the ass that I can't even kill you.

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.940
You're so cute.

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:26.820
You can't be like that.

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:28.780
Look at your nails.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.000
You didn't eat the meat and the vegetables, did you?

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:37.880
I'm the one who ate them all.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.940
I'm not going to let you get away with this.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:45.120
You're a good-for-nothing.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:49.160
I'm not going to let you get away with this.

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:50.740
I'm not going to let you get away with this.

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:50.840
You don't want to be beaten?

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:59.510
I'm not going to be beaten.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.140
What?

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:05.850
I don't have any medicine to make you look stupid.

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:06.410
What?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:30.200
There are three.

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:57.640
I'll try hitting it in the back.

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:58.860
I think I can get a little more out of him.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:01.980
Then, let's go to bed!

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:02.300
No.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:44.250
I'll pay you 25 ryo per month.

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:56.850
I'll come to see you tomorrow.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:05.480
Hey.

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:05.800
Huh?

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:11.380
I'm not interested!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:50.140
I don't know where you're coming from, but you've got 25 million yen in your pocket.

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:52.110
If you run away, that's it.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.130
Leave it to me.

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:54.960
I don't have time to run away.

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:57.290
I'm going to beat you up from now on.

00:21:58.180 --> 00:21:58.640
Those cowards.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.160
I've been trying to find him, but I can't find him.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:05.340
If I go after him now, I'll be in trouble.

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:06.940
I see.

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:10.450
But if you do that, you'll have to pay another 25 ryo, right?

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:16.890
If I go after him, I'll have to pay another 50 ryo.

00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:18.310
That's too much.

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:19.330
Shut up.

00:22:19.530 --> 00:22:22.530
If you don't do that, I won't be able to fix you.

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:25.000
There's a lot of dirty stuff in the police station.

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:25.460
That's right.

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:29.070
If I don't get caught, I'll be in trouble.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.220
Why don't you kill him?

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:33.310
He's my friend.

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:40.070
I don't hate him.

00:22:42.080 --> 00:22:44.650
I don't care if you kill someone.

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:46.870
I don't care if you kill someone.

00:22:47.240 --> 00:22:49.770
I killed a man.

00:22:50.790 --> 00:22:51.870
You killed a man.

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:52.750
You killed a man.

00:22:52.790 --> 00:22:59.220
You killed a man.

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:00.900
It's just one time to tie your neck.

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:16.730
25.

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:29.640
Sensei, I'll tie your face.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.780
One key, one key.

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:35.250
Yohichiro Segare, Orin Nyobo.

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:38.550
Shimuji Kumagutaro, the head of the Anome family.

00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:42.460
Yohachi Sugito, Matsukichi Sagashita, Sukeji Dote.

00:23:43.180 --> 00:23:45.160
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:51.100
What's your name?

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:03.350
What's your name?

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:06.660
I'm Sanjuro.

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:08.720
I'm about to become Shijuro.

00:24:09.160 --> 00:24:10.260
Are you kidding me?

00:24:10.480 --> 00:24:13.120
I'm Sabatake Sanjuro.

00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:15.740
I don't know what kind of horse you are.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.390
You're sitting here. Come here.

00:24:33.530 --> 00:24:34.420
I'm here.

00:24:34.800 --> 00:24:38.360
50 ryo and 1 ryo and 2 bu are different.

00:24:39.080 --> 00:24:44.520
I'll show you my true power.

00:24:45.100 --> 00:24:47.600
Then let me see him.

00:24:47.800 --> 00:24:53.400
I'll show him my true power.

00:24:54.010 --> 00:24:56.880
I'll show you my true power.

00:24:57.160 --> 00:24:59.640
I'll show you my true power.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:01.550
If you don't stop me, I won't be able to win.

00:25:02.710 --> 00:25:03.330
Okay, then.

00:25:03.330 --> 00:25:12.420
I'm going to have you and Sotsubo-sensei go to the front.

00:25:13.040 --> 00:25:14.580
I'm going to beat you to death.

00:26:05.820 --> 00:26:06.280
Shut up!

00:26:07.770 --> 00:26:14.360
I won't let you get away with this!

00:26:36.364 --> 00:26:36.864
PLEASE!

00:26:36.972 --> 00:26:37.572
Please!

00:28:20.090 --> 00:28:21.620
It's obvious that you're going to get in a fight.

00:28:22.300 --> 00:28:23.880
Let's call it a day.

00:28:23.880 --> 00:28:26.640
I was scared.

00:28:31.400 --> 00:28:31.740
They ran away!

00:29:02.080 --> 00:29:02.740
That's all I want to say.

00:29:02.920 --> 00:29:03.860
You're so annoying.

00:30:02.170 --> 00:30:02.750
Oh

00:30:30.670 --> 00:30:31.130
Oh

00:31:45.350 --> 00:31:47.480
You'll be the one to pull the trigger.

00:31:47.680 --> 00:31:48.960
Leave that man alone.

00:31:49.420 --> 00:31:57.820
I'll walk with him and take the boat.

00:31:58.460 --> 00:31:59.540
Got it?

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:02.040
There was no dog fight between Manami and Tenkyo!

00:32:36.010 --> 00:32:53.730
He's a good-for-nothing, but he's a good-for-nothing.

00:33:06.560 --> 00:33:07.380
Hehehehe

00:33:07.380 --> 00:33:08.940
That's strange

00:33:08.940 --> 00:33:12.310
The man who was born on that day drank tea

00:33:12.310 --> 00:33:13.530
So what?

00:33:13.850 --> 00:33:14.150
Look

00:33:35.880 --> 00:33:36.500
Don't get mad at me.

00:33:36.640 --> 00:33:44.850
I thought I'd get away with it if I made them kill each other.

00:33:45.410 --> 00:33:53.220
It's none of your business.

00:33:53.620 --> 00:33:59.140
Do you think you can get away with it?

00:34:00.280 --> 00:34:01.160
I'm not the only one who's quiet.

00:34:01.980 --> 00:34:03.180
That's right.

00:34:03.420 --> 00:34:05.620
I'll do something about it.

00:34:05.620 --> 00:34:10.230
I don't know which one goes first, but I'll pick you up.

00:34:10.230 --> 00:34:13.630
I just want to win the fight.

00:34:13.950 --> 00:34:16.350
I want the coat, too.

00:34:16.650 --> 00:34:20.740
Watch me.

00:34:20.920 --> 00:34:21.100
Oh.

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:31.060
Is that your Donchuk?

00:35:02.460 --> 00:35:02.720
You

00:35:30.190 --> 00:35:30.630
Thank you.

00:36:04.350 --> 00:36:04.590
Bye-bye.

00:36:30.720 --> 00:36:44.810
Go and die a happy life.

00:36:45.000 --> 00:36:45.720
I'm not sure if I can do it.

00:36:46.540 --> 00:36:54.800
I want to try it, too.

00:36:54.800 --> 00:36:55.540
Wake up!

00:37:01.210 --> 00:37:01.370
Thank you.

00:37:31.920 --> 00:37:32.580
Good morning, Yoko.

00:37:32.620 --> 00:37:35.490
You're really something.

00:37:36.050 --> 00:37:38.010
I like you.

00:37:38.490 --> 00:37:42.090
Aren't you going to get in trouble for beating up the three of us?

00:37:43.830 --> 00:37:44.990
What are you talking about?

00:37:45.090 --> 00:37:48.710
And that little brother of yours...

00:37:48.710 --> 00:37:49.070
Inokichi.

00:37:49.270 --> 00:37:50.710
You know him?

00:37:50.850 --> 00:37:52.880
He's a strong guy.

00:37:53.400 --> 00:37:55.790
He's not that kind of guy.

00:38:00.440 --> 00:38:01.640
You stink of water.

00:38:02.280 --> 00:38:03.500
Why don't you drink at home?

00:38:04.120 --> 00:38:05.310
Are you still angry?

00:38:05.770 --> 00:38:06.960
I'm not angry.

00:38:07.420 --> 00:38:08.160
You're mean.

00:38:08.480 --> 00:38:10.490
You didn't listen to me.

00:38:10.490 --> 00:38:11.450
You're a bad teacher.

00:38:11.890 --> 00:38:12.270
Let's go.

00:38:12.810 --> 00:38:16.740
I didn't mean to do that.

00:38:16.840 --> 00:38:18.890
Give me a drink.

00:38:19.790 --> 00:38:21.850
I'll pay for it.

00:38:22.090 --> 00:38:23.520
I'll pay for what you did.

00:38:24.780 --> 00:38:27.750
If you do that, I'll beat you up.

00:38:27.950 --> 00:38:29.710
Bastard!

00:38:58.760 --> 00:38:59.140
How about yakisaki?

00:39:03.950 --> 00:39:09.130
If you keep eating like this, your business will go up, too.

00:39:09.510 --> 00:39:11.050
You've been eating for ten days.

00:39:11.810 --> 00:39:13.300
Don't say that.

00:39:13.910 --> 00:39:17.100
Thanks to me, there are a lot of people around here.

00:39:17.100 --> 00:39:19.490
Shut up! This is not a brothel.

00:39:19.770 --> 00:39:21.460
If you want to keep eating, go to Seibe.

00:39:22.220 --> 00:39:23.800
That's not good.

00:39:25.470 --> 00:39:27.490
Seibe and Ushitora are trying to get me.

00:39:30.060 --> 00:39:31.740
I will do my best to make both sides pay attention.

00:39:52.390 --> 00:39:52.730
I don't need this eye.

00:40:19.840 --> 00:40:20.960
Come to my place right away.

00:40:21.140 --> 00:40:24.230
What are you in a hurry for?

00:40:24.370 --> 00:40:27.160
I'll be out of town tomorrow.

00:40:30.990 --> 00:40:32.250
About 10 people were killed in the other building.

00:40:33.730 --> 00:40:39.740
That's not a big deal.

00:40:40.040 --> 00:40:42.760
We have to come at night.

00:40:43.240 --> 00:40:46.560
You know everything.

00:40:47.060 --> 00:40:50.800
You're the one who killed them.

00:40:53.780 --> 00:40:54.080
Maybe.

00:40:54.680 --> 00:40:59.330
If they get caught, we'll be in big trouble.

00:41:00.280 --> 00:41:00.900
I don't want to be a fool.

00:41:01.980 --> 00:41:04.100
I see.

00:41:04.480 --> 00:41:08.980
By the way, 30 ryo for each coin.

00:41:08.980 --> 00:41:11.740
